PROJECT NAME:
MRFlix — Premium Netflix-Style OTT Streaming Platform

PROJECT TYPE:
Production-Oriented, Mobile-First OTT User Panel

DELIVERY REQUIREMENT:
ONE COMPLETE, SELF-CONTAINED HTML FILE.

The final output must be a complete working index.html containing:
HTML + CSS + JavaScript + Firebase Integration.

Do not split the implementation into multiple HTML, CSS, or JavaScript files.

Do not provide only a mockup, design preview, wireframe, pseudocode, or incomplete demo.

